{"topicCode":"APPX02","details":"<h1 class=\"study-h1\">考古題盲點與常見陷阱辨析</h1>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">整理歷屆 iPAS 考生在單選題中最常混淆的十大核心觀念陷阱與出題套路，應考時務必精準識別干擾選項。</p>\n<hr class=\"study-divider\">\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">陷阱 1：七大浪費中「最嚴重、最根本」的浪費是哪一項？</h3>\n<ul class=\"study-list\">\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">典型誘答選項</strong>：不良品製造的浪費、等待的浪費。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">正確正解</strong>：<strong class=\"study-strong\">過量生產（Overproduction）</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">考點陷阱剖析</strong>：</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">許多考生直覺認為不良品報廢最浪費成本。但大野耐一與精實管理理論明確指出，過量生產會提早消耗原料、占用倉儲空間與資金，更嚴重的是它會「掩蓋」現場的品質變異、機台故障與不平衡工時等真實問題，故被定為七大浪費之首。</p>\n<hr class=\"study-divider\">\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">陷阱 2：OEE 六大損失與三大指標之歸屬混淆</h3>\n<ul class=\"study-list\">\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">常考錯混題型</strong>：</li>\n<li>「換模架模與調整（Setup and Adjustment）」屬於哪一項損失？</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">正解</strong>：<strong class=\"study-strong\">時間稼動率（Availability）損失</strong>。屬於計畫內的停機作業時間，不是性能損失。</li>\n<li>「卡料微小停機（Idling and Minor Stops, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$&lt;5\\text{ min}$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>&nbsp;min</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;5\\text{ min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&nbsp;min</span></span></span></span></span></span>）」屬於哪一項損失？</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">正解</strong>：<strong class=\"study-strong\">性能稼動率（Performance）損失</strong>。現場不會為了 30 秒卡料開立停機單，但它會實質拖慢加工總週期。</li>\n<li>「開機暖機產出的廢件」屬於哪一項損失？</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">正解</strong>：<strong class=\"study-strong\">良品率（Quality）損失</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr class=\"study-divider\">\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">陷阱 3：計數值管制圖選型四選一（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$p, np, c, u$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p, np, c, u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span>）</h3>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">題目描述一長串現場條件，考生常在四張圖之間游移：</p>\n<div class=\"control-chart-selector\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"計數值管制圖選型流程：先判斷檢驗對象；不良品個數依樣本數是否固定選 p 或 np 圖，缺點瑕疵數依檢驗單位是否固定選 c 或 u 圖。\">\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1040 670\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <defs>\n      <linearGradient id=\"selector-question\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop stop-color=\"#eef2ff\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#ddd6fe\"></stop></linearGradient>\n      <linearGradient id=\"selector-result\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop stop-color=\"#ecfdf5\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#d1fae5\"></stop></linearGradient>\n      <marker id=\"selector-arrow\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\" fill=\"#6366f1\"></path></marker>\n      <style>.selector-line { fill: none; stroke: #6366f1; stroke-width: 3; marker-end: url(#selector-arrow); } .selector-question { fill: url(#selector-question); stroke: #6366f1; stroke-width: 2.5; } .selector-result { fill: url(#selector-result); stroke: #059669; stroke-width: 2.5; } .selector-label { fill: #334155; font: 600 16px 'Inter', 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif; } .selector-main { fill: #1e1b4b; font: 700 21px 'Inter', 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif; } .selector-result-text { fill: #065f46; font: 700 20px 'Inter', 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif; } .selector-sub { fill: #475569; font: 500 15px 'Inter', 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif; }</style>\n    </defs>\n    <rect x=\"360\" y=\"25\" width=\"320\" height=\"70\" rx=\"16\" class=\"selector-question\"></rect>\n    <text x=\"520\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-main\">檢驗對象是？</text>\n    <path d=\"M 440 95 L 250 155\" class=\"selector-line\"></path>\n    <path d=\"M 600 95 L 790 155\" class=\"selector-line\"></path>\n    <text x=\"270\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-label\">不良品個數 (Defective)</text>\n    <text x=\"770\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-label\">缺點瑕疵數 (Defect)</text>\n    <rect x=\"75\" y=\"165\" width=\"350\" height=\"74\" rx=\"16\" class=\"selector-result\"></rect>\n    <text x=\"250\" y=\"208\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-result-text\">計件數據</text>\n    <rect x=\"615\" y=\"165\" width=\"350\" height=\"74\" rx=\"16\" class=\"selector-result\"></rect>\n    <text x=\"790\" y=\"198\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-result-text\">計點數據</text>\n    <text x=\"790\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-sub\">同一物件可有多處瑕疵</text>\n    <path d=\"M 250 239 L 250 300\" class=\"selector-line\"></path>\n    <path d=\"M 790 239 L 790 300\" class=\"selector-line\"></path>\n    <rect x=\"75\" y=\"310\" width=\"350\" height=\"78\" rx=\"16\" class=\"selector-question\"></rect>\n    <text x=\"250\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-main\">每批樣本數 n 是否固定？</text>\n    <rect x=\"615\" y=\"310\" width=\"350\" height=\"78\" rx=\"16\" class=\"selector-question\"></rect>\n    <text x=\"790\" y=\"345\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-main\">檢驗單位是否固定？</text>\n    <text x=\"790\" y=\"369\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-sub\">面積、長度或檢驗單位</text>\n    <path d=\"M 175 388 L 175 465\" class=\"selector-line\"></path>\n    <path d=\"M 325 388 L 325 465\" class=\"selector-line\"></path>\n    <path d=\"M 715 388 L 715 465\" class=\"selector-line\"></path>\n    <path d=\"M 865 388 L 865 465\" class=\"selector-line\"></path>\n    <text x=\"130\" y=\"432\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-label\">每次不同</text>\n    <text x=\"370\" y=\"432\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-label\">嚴格固定相同</text>\n    <text x=\"670\" y=\"432\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-label\">固定</text>\n    <text x=\"910\" y=\"432\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-label\">不固定</text>\n    <rect x=\"45\" y=\"480\" width=\"260\" height=\"125\" rx=\"18\" class=\"selector-result\"></rect>\n    <text x=\"175\" y=\"526\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-result-text\">p 管制圖</text>\n    <text x=\"175\" y=\"556\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-sub\">不良率</text>\n    <rect x=\"315\" y=\"480\" width=\"260\" height=\"125\" rx=\"18\" class=\"selector-result\"></rect>\n    <text x=\"445\" y=\"526\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-result-text\">np 管制圖</text>\n    <text x=\"445\" y=\"556\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-sub\">不良數</text>\n    <rect x=\"585\" y=\"480\" width=\"260\" height=\"125\" rx=\"18\" class=\"selector-result\"></rect>\n    <text x=\"715\" y=\"526\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-result-text\">c 管制圖</text>\n    <text x=\"715\" y=\"556\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-sub\">固定單位的缺點數</text>\n    <text x=\"715\" y=\"580\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-sub\">例：固定 1 平方米鋼板</text>\n    <rect x=\"855\" y=\"480\" width=\"140\" height=\"125\" rx=\"18\" class=\"selector-result\"></rect>\n    <text x=\"925\" y=\"526\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-result-text\">u 圖</text>\n    <text x=\"925\" y=\"556\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-sub\">單位平均</text>\n    <text x=\"925\" y=\"580\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"selector-sub\">缺點數</text>\n  </svg>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"study-divider\">\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">陷阱 4：Modbus 暫存器位址與讀寫權限對稱性</h3>\n<ul class=\"study-list\">\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">離散輸入（Discrete Inputs, 10001~）</strong>：<strong class=\"study-strong\">唯讀 1 位元</strong>。用來接實體行程開關或急停按鈕。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">線圈（Coils, 00001~）</strong>：<strong class=\"study-strong\">可讀可寫 1 位元</strong>。用來驅動實體電磁閥或三色燈。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">輸入暫存器（Input Registers, 30001~）</strong>：<strong class=\"study-strong\">唯讀 16 位元</strong>。用來讀取外部類比感測器電壓/電流換算值。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">保持暫存器（Holding Registers, 40001~）</strong>：<strong class=\"study-strong\">可讀可寫 16 位元</strong>。用來設定馬達目標轉速或 PID 目標溫控值。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">常考陷阱</strong>：題目常問「若要由圖控 SCADA 遠端修改機台溫控設定值，應寫入哪類暫存器？」考生若誤選 Input Register 即落入唯讀陷阱，正解必為 <strong class=\"study-strong\">Holding Register</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr class=\"study-divider\">\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">陷阱 5：數位雙生 (Digital Twin) vs 數位影子 (Digital Shadow)</h3>\n<ul class=\"study-list\">\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">干擾盲點</strong>：只要在電腦上有 3D 擬真模型或 SCADA 監控畫面，就是數位雙生？</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">辨析關鍵</strong>：</li>\n<li>若資料流只是「實體 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$\\to$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\to</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> 虛擬」單向採集呈現，只能稱為<strong class=\"study-strong\">數位影子（Digital Shadow）</strong>。</li>\n<li>必須具備「實體 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$\\leftrightarrow$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>↔</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leftrightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span></span></span></span></span> 虛擬」<strong class=\"study-strong\">全自動雙向閉迴路反饋（Closed-Loop Control）</strong>，即模型運算出的最佳參數能自主反寫回控制器，才能稱為<strong class=\"study-strong\">數位雙生（Digital Twin）</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr class=\"study-divider\">\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">陷阱 6：AGV 與 AMR 的本質技術界線</h3>\n<ul class=\"study-list\">\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">常考題目</strong>：工廠產線走道常有作業員走動與堆高機交會，欲導入無需破壞地面施工且能自主繞越障礙物的無人搬運載具，應選擇何者？</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">干擾選項</strong>：磁帶導引 AGV、QR Code 網格 AGV。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">正解</strong>：<strong class=\"study-strong\">自主移動機器人（AMR）</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">關鍵差異</strong>：AGV 循固定軌跡行走，遇障礙物只能停車等待；AMR 採用光學雷達（LiDAR）搭配 SLAM 即時定位與動態路徑規劃，具備自主「繞障」能力。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr class=\"study-divider\">\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">陷阱 7：品質檢測的漏檢 (Underkill) 與過檢 (Overkill)</h3>\n<ul class=\"study-list\">\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">漏檢（Underkill / 假陰性 False Negative, FN）</strong>：不良品被判為良品流入客戶端。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">危害</strong>：觸發客戶退換貨（RMA）、商譽毀損與產線召回，屬於最嚴重的<strong class=\"study-strong\">外部失敗成本</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">過檢（Overkill / 假陽性 False Positive, FP）</strong>：良品被誤判為不良品。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">危害</strong>：增加複檢人員工時負擔與重修作業成本，屬於<strong class=\"study-strong\">鑑定與內部失敗成本</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">防錯原則</strong>：在 AOI 演算法門檻調校時，寧可微幅拉高過檢率，也<strong class=\"study-strong\">絕對不允許漏檢率升高</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr class=\"study-divider\">\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">陷阱 8：EBOM 與 MBOM 的欄位差異</h3>\n<ul class=\"study-list\">\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">題目特徵</strong>：下列何者「通常僅出現在 MBOM，而不會出現在 EBOM」中？</li>\n<li><strong class=\"study-strong\">正解清單</strong>：</li>\n<li>組裝使用的工業快乾膠水、潤滑油（無獨立 CAD 零件圖之輔料）。</li>\n<li>防靜電氣泡袋、出貨包裝外箱、封箱膠帶。</li>\n<li>外包工序料號（如委外陽極處理、熱處理之過渡代碼）。</li>\n<li>虛擬件（Phantom Assembly）。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr class=\"study-divider\">\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">陷阱 9：標準工時計算之「外加法」與「內含法」</h3>\n<ul class=\"study-list\">\n<li>若題目寫「寬放率 20%」，且未特別強調時，台灣工業工程檢定預設為<strong class=\"study-strong\">外加法</strong>：</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"></p><div class=\"math-block\" data-raw-math=\"$$\\text{ST} = \\text{NT} \\times (1 + 0.20) = 1.20 \\times \\text{NT}$$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ST</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>NT</mtext><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.20</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1.20</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>NT</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ST} = \\text{NT} \\times (1 + 0.20) = 1.20 \\times \\text{NT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ST</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.20</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NT</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p></p>\n<ul class=\"study-list\">\n<li>若題目特別註明「寬放時間佔標準工時之 20%」，則必須採用<strong class=\"study-strong\">內含法</strong>：</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\"></p><div class=\"math-block\" data-raw-math=\"$$\\text{ST} = \\frac{\\text{NT}}{1 - 0.20} = \\frac{\\text{NT}}{0.80} = 1.25 \\times \\text{NT}$$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ST</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>NT</mtext><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.20</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>NT</mtext><mn>0.80</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1.25</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>NT</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ST} = \\frac{\\text{NT}}{1 - 0.20} = \\frac{\\text{NT}}{0.80} = 1.25 \\times \\text{NT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ST</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.20</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NT</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.80</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NT</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.25</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NT</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p></p>\n<p class=\"study-paragraph\">*兩者計算結果相差顯著，審題時務必確認字眼！*</p>\n<hr class=\"study-divider\">\n<h3 class=\"study-h3\">陷阱 10：派工法則之績效目標對應</h3>\n<ul class=\"study-list\">\n<li>欲將「全廠平均在製品（WIP）存量」與「平均流程時間」降至最低 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$\\to$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\to</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> 選擇 <strong class=\"study-strong\">SPT（最短加工時間優先）</strong>。</li>\n<li>欲防止客戶訂單嚴重逾期、將「最大延遲時間」降至最低 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$\\to$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\to</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> 選擇 <strong class=\"study-strong\">EDD（最早交期優先）</strong>。</li>\n<li>動態調整緊急插單優先權 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$\\to$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\to</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> 選擇 <strong class=\"study-strong\">CR（臨界比法則，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-raw-math=\"$&lt;1$\" data-math-done=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 者最優先）</strong>。</li>\n</ul>"}
